\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Taiwan, peso test fresh lows, rest up. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Ovais Subhani \par \uc2 690 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 2002\par 05:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Oct 3 (Reuters) - The Taiwan dollar eased past a \par \par \uc2  key barrier of 35 per dollar to one-week lows and the \par \par \uc2  Philippine peso tested a fresh 14-month trough in early \par \par \uc2  Thursday trade. \par \par \uc2      Dealers in Singapore said the Taiwan dollar hit a one-week \par \par \uc2  low of 35.015, before talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  capped \par \par \uc2  its fall. \par \par \uc2      They said players were concerned about a potential rise in \par \par \uc2  outflow of dollars from Taiwan, after recent net sales of local \par \par \uc2  stocks by foreign investors. \par \par \uc2      Foreign equity funds were net sellers of T$852.7 million of \par \par \uc2  Taiwan stocks on Wednesday, taking net selling to around T$56.2 \par \par \uc2  billion over the past five weeks. \par \par \uc2      Talk of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's presence in the market also \par \par \uc2  helped the Philippine peso off a fresh 14-month low of 52.66 \par \par \uc2  per dollar, hit early on, as speculation over a worsening \par \par \uc2  budget deficit grew. \par \par \uc2      Finance Secretary Jose Camacho said on Wednesday the \par \par \uc2  government if needed would tap local markets for funding the \par \par \uc2  deficit and ruled out further offshore borrowings. \par \par \uc2      "Peso sentiment remains very fragile...deficit rumours \par \par \uc2  continue to weigh and corporate dollar demand for hedging oil \par \par \uc2  import bills shows no sign of abating," said a JP Morgan Chase \par \par \uc2  research note. \par \par \uc2      WALL STREET CAPS DOLLAR \par \par \uc2      Other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  edged up as U.S. stock losses capped \par \par \uc2  the dollar's recent gains against the yen and euro \par \par \uc2      However, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analysts saw limited upside for regional \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and recommended players take advantage of the move \par \par \uc2  to build fresh long dollar positions. \par \par \uc2      South Korea's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was closed on Thursday for a \par \par \uc2  national holiday and will reopen on Friday. \par \par \uc2      The Korean won ended onshore trade at 1,230.4 per dollar on \par \par \uc2  Wednesday against Tuesday's close of 1,227.7, its first close \par \par \uc2  below the key 1,230 level since late June. \par \par \uc2      The dollar in early Asian trade touched session lows around \par \par \uc2  122.50 yen and 98.65 cents against the euro, weighed down by a \par \par \uc2  fall in the Dow Jones average of over two percent overnight. \par \par \uc2      Players were also reluctant to hold long dollar positions \par \par \uc2  ahead of U.S. unemployment data for September due on Friday. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said players in regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , taking a cue \par \par \uc2  from the majors, booked profits on the dollar's recent gains. \par \par \uc2  They said some momentum was added to the move as stop-loss \par \par \uc2  dollar sell orders were triggered along the way. \par \par \uc2      The Singapore dollar rebounded aggressively to around \par \par \uc2  1.7825 in early trade after seeing the sharpest slide among the \par \par \uc2  regionals on Wednesday, to 3-=   month lows around 1.7925 per \par \par \uc2  dollar. \par \par \uc2      But the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was swiftly sold down to levels around \par \par \uc2  1.7850 as the profit-taking faded and players took fresh long \par \par \uc2  dollar positions. \par \par \uc2      "Clearly amidst the raft of GDP downgrades from various \par \par \uc2  economists over the last few weeks, the market has also changed \par \par \uc2  its assessment of the prospects for this \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Bhanu \par \par \uc2  Baweja, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at UBS Warburg in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The latest downgrade of Singapore's growth prospects for \par \par \uc2  2002 and 2003 came on Wednesday from Morgan Stanley, which \par \par \uc2  cited uncertain global recovery and slack demand. \par \par \uc2  Baweja said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can go a long way lower as the yen \par \par \uc2  and euro could ease down to 123 and 98.30 respectively. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar/Sing can appreciate to 1.8150 before the MAS (\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore) comes in to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ". \par \par \uc2      The Thai baht ticked up to around 43.47 per dollar, off \par \par \uc2  Wednesday's 43.57, the lowest this week. \par \par \uc2      Dealers in Singapore said the baht's upmove was also \par \par \uc2  influenced by an easing of foreign selling of local stocks, \par \par \uc2  helping sentiment, and on fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Dealers said authorities checked \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates in the market \par \par \uc2  on Wednesday, but added that there was no evidence of actual \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOT) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  yet. \par \par \uc2      "Despite recent BOT support, the baht has weakened through \par \par \uc2  the 43.50 level already, and though moves may be gradual, we \par \par \uc2  maintain it will slip to 44.5 in a month's time," Baweja of UBS \par \par \uc2  Warburg said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021003dya3006sj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
