\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-No plans to fire Thai c.bank chief - minister. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Vithoon Amorn \par \uc2 350 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 August 2002\par 11:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Aug 2 (Reuters) - Thailand's finance minister said on Friday the government had no plans to fire Bank of Thailand Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula despite complaints by Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra that the baht was too volatile. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Somkid Jatusripitak told reporters the government was not trying to interfere in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's mandate to manage the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Asked whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor would be replaced, Somkid said: "No. Everything is okay. The prime minister has not criticised (the governor). All parties agree that the Bank of Thailand should be given full authority to manage the baht." \par \par \uc2  Thaksin reprimanded the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday for not doing enough to curb the volatility of the baht, and demanded action to restrain the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's swings. \par \par \uc2  The baht hit a two-year high of 40.20 to the dollar last month but has since weakened and was trading at 42.075 by 0531 GMT on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  practices a "managed float" regime, saying it allows the baht to move in line with market forces but \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  at times to reduce volatility. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said on Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilise the baht a week ago, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been steady since then. \par \par \uc2  "I have briefed the PM on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and he is quite happy and pleased. There nothing to worry about," Pridiyathorn said. \par \par \uc2  Last month the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged after Thaksin said it would soon strengthen beyond 40 to the dollar. His comments prompted a rebuke from Pridiyathorn, who said Thaksin should refrain from commenting on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  business. \par \par \uc2  In 2001, the government fired previous \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul after a row over the appropriate level of interest rates. The government denied at the time that it was interfering with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  independence. \par \par \uc2  The BOT has bought dollars in its bid to slow the baht appreciation in the past few weeks. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has helped raise \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves to their highest level since January 1997. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020802dy8200jg4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
