\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk Chief:PM No Longer Concerned Over THB Moves \b0\par\par\uc2 350 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 August 2002\par 10:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Bank of Thailand Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said he met with Prime Minister Thaksin Shinawatra Friday and explained to him the recent movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, thereby defusing his concerns over the baht's volatility. \par \par \uc2  "I explained the situation to the prime minister with regard to his concerns over the high volatility of the baht," Pridiyathorn told reporters at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "The premier now understands the situation well and is no longer concerned." \par \par \uc2  Earlier this week, Thaksin criticized the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for failing to curb excess volatility in the baht in recent days, saying he would ask the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to manage the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  more actively. \par \par \uc2  The baht has strengthened this year against the dollar, gaining more than 6% in the first half as a result of the U.S. unit's weakening global trend. \par \par \uc2  However, the baht slipped sharply late last week and early this week following a general rebound in the dollar, a slip that prompted Thaksin's comments. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said he explained to Thaksin that the baht was most volatile July 25 when the yen moved sharply lower to the dollar. That was a public holiday in \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  therefore couldn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  "So we entered the market one day late, Friday, and by Monday the situation was back to normal," he said. \par \par \uc2  Since the baht's flotation in 1997, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been pursuing a managed float exchange-rate policy, allowing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to move in line with the market trend but stepping in to limit excess volatility in either direction. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said he will also talk with exporters to explain to them how to use available risk management tools, such as forward cover and options, to minimize their exposure to exchange rate fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  At 0910 GMT (5:10 a.m. EDT), the dollar was trading at 42.135 baht, slightly down from THB42.155 at Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266 0744; djn.bangkok@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020802dy82000hv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
