\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Fin Min: THB Rise Not Sole Factor Hampering Exports \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juli 2002\par 07:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Thai Finance Minister Somkid Jatusripitak said Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is monitoring the Thai baht to keep it at a competitive level compared with other nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "If the Thai baht stay at a competitive level compared to other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Its strength is not worrisome," Somkid told reporters. \par \par \uc2  He said the Thai baht's current strength isn't the only factor hampering exports and the main factor is the performance of exporters. \par \par \uc2  Previously, he said exporters have to improve their competitiveness in terms of cost-effectiveness, quality and productivity. \par \par \uc2  Thai exports showed a year-on-year contraction in the first quarter of this year, but picked up in the second quarter in line with the economic recovery of the country's trade partners. \par \par \uc2  At 0535 GMT (1:35 a.m. EDT), the dollar was quoted at THB41.115 baht, a fresh 22-month low, in line with its sharp fall against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said recently that the Thai baht was still at a competitive level and had appreciated against the U.S. dollar less than other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  had. \par \par \uc2  However, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  warned that it may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the baht started to move against regional market trends. \par \par \uc2  -By Suttinee Yuvejwattana, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; suttinee.yuvejwattana@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020710dy7a0008u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
