\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht Ends At 21-Month High On General Dlr Weakness \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 2002\par 12:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- The Thai baht ended at a 21-month high against the U.S. dollar in Asian spot trade Monday due to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's continuing weakness against global \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar finished at 41.795 baht, the lowest close since September 2000, compared with THB41.99 at Friday's close. However, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was off its intraday low of THB41.77. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened at THB42 and slipped below THB42 key level on the general bearish outlook towards the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "Onshore and offshore players are selling dollars as they continued to see the pair being pulled down by regional gravity," said a trader at a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  Traders said Bank of Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon to soften the yen's strength briefly gave the U.S. unit a boost against the baht, before it resumed downward spiral. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by BOJ helped the dollar-yen to rebound by one or two yen, but for the dollar-baht, it just helped very marginally," said another trader. \par \par \uc2  Market players' downbeat expectations about the U.S. economy will likely continue to hamper the dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cool down the baht's rise also provided support for the dollar. \par \par \uc2  There was no noticeable evidence of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders expected the U.S. unit to open in Asia Tuesday between THB41.50 and THB41.75. \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020624dy6o000my\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
