\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Stay on high ground, data, Fed eyed. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Anchalee Worrachate \par \uc2 750 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2002\par 12:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, June 21 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  found strength in dollar weakness on Friday but regional bulls lacked the resolve to aggressively push them, fearing central banks might act to rein them in. \par \par \uc2  The Thai baht was kept at 42.00 - a level unbreached since December 26, 2000 - on rumours of the Bank of Thailand's presence in the market. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, said it had no plans to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar hit 2-year lows against the euro and languished around its three-week trough against the yen, clouded by a gaping U.S. current account deficit and wobbly U.S. stocks. \par \par \uc2  Despite the Bank of Japan's remarks earlier on Friday that it did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market following the dollar's brief jump, dealers did not rule out potential \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  later in the day, especially after the dollar/yen broke 123. \par \par \uc2  "Given that market will be very thin in London with the World Cup in progress, this should be an ideal time for the BoJ to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Ron Leven, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Lehman Brothers in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  "If they remain quiet into the close tonight, it will send a message that they are shifting down their level of dollar defence," he said. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar tracked the yen higher, with the momentum picking up after it broke past the 1.7800 barrier for the first time since October 5 last year. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading around 1.7702 in late trade. At current levels, the Sing dollar looks overbought against the U.S. dollar on technical charts. \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian rupiah pared earlier gains, dipping below 8,600 on the back of strong corporate dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  THAI DEBT PLAN \par \par \uc2  Besides fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , market sentiment in \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was weighed on by the government's plan to issue 300 billion baht of bonds this year to help refinance massive debts run up while bailing out banks and finance firms during Asian crisis. \par \par \uc2  "We are still digesting it. But on the surface, this does not look like a good fiscal discipline," said a dealer at a European bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  "The scheme also involves the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  using reserve funds to meet liabilities. If the reserves are converted into the baht from the dollar to meet these liabilities, it could add upward pressure on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  when its export recovery remains fragile," he said. \par \par \uc2  MARKET WATCHES FED, DATA \par \par \uc2  Ahead of a busy week, some players found little incentive to take aggressive positions going into the weekend. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. Federal Reserve meets on June 25-26, with most analysts expecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold its key rates steady. \par \par \uc2  While market consensus is that the U.S. is unlikely to experience a double-dip recession, some contrarians see a good chance of that happening. \par \par \uc2  "There's a 40 percent chance the U.S. GDP growth could turn negative some time in the second half of this year," Stephen Roach, chief economist at Morgan Stanley, told reporters via a video conference from London on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "If that were to occur, one of the bigger surprises will be that the next move of the U.S. Federal Reserve will not be to tighten interest rates, but actually cut interest rates." \par \par \uc2  Singapore will release May consumer prices on Monday and Taiwan is to announce its leading economic indicator on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Thailand will publish its key monthly economic indicators on Friday, which include trade, industrial output and current account data. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. $1001 GMT Change on the day \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Japan yen     122.57       123.81         +1.01\par   Sing dlr      1.7712       1.7830         +0.67\par   Taiwan dlr    33.855       34.023         +0.50\par   Korean won   1219.40      1229.50         +0.83\par   Baht           41.99        42.04         +0.12\par   Peso           50.25        50.25         +0.00\par   Rupiah       8625.00      8590.00         -0.41\par   Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995          0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par   Japan yen     122.57       131.24         +7.07\par   Sing dlr      1.7712       1.8515         +4.53\par   Taiwan dlr    33.855       32.900         -2.82\par   Korean won   1219.40      1277.00         +4.72\par   Baht           41.99        44.16         +5.17\par   Peso           50.25        51.50         +2.49\par   Rupiah       8625.00     10350.00        +20.00\par   Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995          0.00.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020621dy6l00kiz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
