\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Ctrl Bk:US Events Almost No Impact On  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 372 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 September 2001\par 06:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK -(Dow Jones)- Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Pridiyathorn Devakula said the central didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Wednesday as there was almost no impact on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market from Tuesday's terrorist attacks in the U.S. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn told a news conference he was comfortable with the level of the baht, noting that the dollar didn't weaken as much as had been expected following the attacks. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is closely monitoring the market to ensure that liquidity in the system is sufficient," he said. \par \par \uc2  At 0511 GMT (1:11 a.m. EDT), the baht was trading at THB44.39 to the dollar, slightly stronger from THB44.425 at the open and THB44.80 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  In one of the most horrifying attacks ever against the U.S., terrorists on Tuesday morning crashed two airliners into the World Trade Center in New York. Another plane crashed into the Pentagon near Washington, collapsing one side of the building, and a fourth airliner crashed in a field 80 miles southeast of Pittsburgh. No one has yet claimed responsibility for the attacks. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said a total THB9 billion was injected into the system by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the repurchase market and from commercial banks with excess liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Traders said earlier that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was injecting funds through its 2.5% policy-signal 14-day repo rate. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  took place in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  or bond markets. He also called on banks to settle their baht obligations to prevent liquidity shortages. \par \par \uc2  Pridiyathorn said the Bank of Thailand will wait to see the wider economic impact of Tuesday's events before taking any needed actions or changing the bank's economic predictions. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently revised its 2001 gross domestic product growth forecast to a range of 1.5%-2% from a 2%-3% range previously. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have said the Thai economy was already on the brink of recession. Second-quarter GDP data, due Monday, is expected to show either a contraction for the second consecutive quarter or very weak growth. \par \par \uc2  -By Phisanu Phromchanya, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266 0744; phisanu.phromchanya@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010912dx9c000bg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
